  "saferAlternatives": [
    "Use --profile memory-only (5 tools) or --profile coding-agent (19 tools) instead of --profile full (39 tools); krusch_context_health runs read-only SELECT and file-hash checks without DB writes.",
    "Keep krusch_tool_call blocked under Guard and run krusch-stack without --defer-tools (or invoke target MCP tools directly) so Guard evaluates each target tool against its own policy rule.",
    "Keep krusch_run, krusch_apply_diff, write_drive_file, krusch_fs_sync, brick_try_local, and brick_adopt on Review because they execute commands, run sandboxes, or write files."
